id: pm-web-4fgv
title: Graph auto-sync provisions an extension before checking whether Neo4j is configured
description: "Every item mutation schedules graph synchronization. With no Neo4j credentials, syncProjectGraph still installs and activates pm-graph in the workspace before syncGraphToNeo4j refuses the operation. This causes unnecessary network work, workspace mutation, delayed failures, and slow test teardown. Validate graph configuration before provisioning; retain both existing failure notifications and prove the behavior over real HTTP and SSE."
